{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"{\n  \"additions\": [\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:1\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供波兰队列中饮食模式（高植物/低乳制品）与特定菌群协同影响抗PD-1疗效的实证，支撑“微生物标志物具有人群与生活方式依赖性”的分析。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n          \"contribution\": \"系统综述黑色素瘤数据，揭示真菌失调与较差预后的关联，补充单一细菌视角局限，论证多界微生物生态对ICI疗效的综合调节作用。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0511\",\n          \"contribution\": \"基于转移性黑色素瘤宏基因组荟萃分析，确认维生素B代谢通路富集与响应正相关，为“功能趋同优于单一分类学标志物”提供跨队列统计支持。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:2\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0517\",\n          \"contribution\": \"证实NSCLC中抗生素暴露的负面效应高度依赖PD-L1表达水平，为“宿主生物标志物状态严格修饰微生物干预效应方向”提供临床分层依据。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0576\",\n          \"contribution\": \"系统综述明确ICI启动前30天内的抗生素暴露是预后恶化的核心风险窗口，同期暴露影响较弱，量化时间窗特异性并提示需区分暴露时机进行校正。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0548\",\n          \"contribution\": \"整合多尺度证据指出抗生素效应在不同实体瘤中存在异质性，警示简单归因于“菌群破坏”，强调需结合肿瘤免疫原性与疾病背景综合评估。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:3\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0569\",\n          \"contribution\": \"报道早期NSCLC新辅助治疗中低基线α多样性与高纵向稳定性预示较好病理缓解，对比晚期研究结果，阐明疾病阶段与治疗强度对动态标志物的情境修饰。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详述MIMic试验中供体菌株定植动力学与临床获益的关联，指出持久定植者获得更长生存，为“纵向生态重塑轨迹优于单次静态丰度”提供因果验证线索。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n          \"contribution\": \"梳理活体生物制品与后生元在临床试验中的动态监测需求，指出标准化采样频率与存储条件缺失是阻碍纵向数据转化为临床决策的主要方法学瓶颈。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:4\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n          \"contribution\": \"通过人源化小鼠FMT实验确立irAEs发生的微生物因果链，并构建随机森林预测模型，为“安全性信号受宿主免疫背景与菌群特征共同驱动”提供机制与工具支撑。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n          \"contribution\": \"对比FMT、益生菌与工程菌的临床转化现状，指出供体筛选标准与给药方案异质性是导致概念验证试验结果分化的主因，界定当前干预策略的适用边界。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出肠道-代谢物-免疫轴框架，详述特定代谢物（如吲哚类、SCFAs）在减轻irAEs同时维持抗肿瘤活性的潜力，为平衡疗效与毒性提供分子干预思路。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    - **Role/Task:** Academic review planning editor. Goal: Plan substantive content for a long-form review. Output only JSON with `additions` array.\n    - **Input Data:** A complex JSON structure containing `unit_catalog`, `source_routing`, `source_materials`, etc., for Chapter 1 (Ch1) of a microbiome-ICI review.\n    - **Chapter/Units:** Ch1 has 4 units:\n        - `Ch1:1`: Clinical association evidence across cancer types (U1_跨癌种关联图谱)\n        - `Ch1:2`: External interference & host background (U2_外部干扰与宿主背景)\n        - `Ch1:3`: Dynamic monitoring & longitudinal evolution (U3_动态监测与纵向演变)\n        - `Ch1:4`: Evidence ladder & translation boundaries (U4_证据阶梯与转化边界)\n    - **Constraints:**\n        - Only plan substantive knowledge/analysis for the main text.\n        - No Q&A format.\n        - Return JSON only: `{\"additions\": [{\"unit_key\": \"...\", \"studies\": [{\"source_handle\": \"...\", \"contribution\": \"...\"}]}]}`\n        - Each addition must have a specific unit_key, source_handle, and contribution (~30-60 Chinese chars explaining its role in the unit).\n        - Do not duplicate existing cases/supporting_studies. New papers must add different results, conditions, methods, developmental stages, or useful comparisons.\n        - Keep original metadata/handles. Distinguish correlation vs causation, mechanisms, migration/application, validation, uncertainty.\n        - Match the provided `source_materials` actual content.\n        - Target ~150-200 independent lit for the whole review, but this batch just adds what's needed for these units.\n        - Follow the exact output contract.\n\n2.  **Evaluate Existing Cases/Supporting Studies per Unit:**\n    I need to check what's already in `supporting_studies` for each unit to avoid duplication and find gaps.\n\n    *Unit Ch1:1 (U1_跨癌种关联图谱)*\n    Existing: P0096, P0170, P0015, P0298, P0204, P0289, P0270, P0393, P0364, P0437.\n    Focus: Cross-cancer signals, lack of universal marker, statistical heterogeneity, treatment regimen modifiers.\n    Gaps/Opportunities: Need more on functional convergence vs taxonomic inconsistency, population-specific signatures, or multi-kingdom interactions. Let's look at available sources.\n    Available sources in routing/materials: P0496 (reproducible biomarkers, functional dispersion), P0511 (meta-analysis melanoma, vitamin B pathways), P0545 (Polish cohort, population-specific diet/microbiome), P0565 (systematic review melanoma, fungal dysbiosis), P0534 (qualitative review, ecosystem model).\n    Selection: P0545 (population-specific/diet interaction), P0565 (fungal dysbiosis context), P0511 (functional pathway meta-analysis).\n\n    *Unit Ch1:2 (U2_外部干扰与宿主背景)*\n    Existing: P0123, P0157, P0033, P0236, P0266, P0289, P0275, P0339, P0360, P0421.\n    Focus: Antibiotics/PPIs timing/dose, combination therapy modifiers, indication bias/correction.\n    Gaps/Opportunities: Need more on corticosteroids, specific antibiotic classes/spectrums, or host factors like muscle mass/comorbidities interacting with microbiome. Also, P0517 (NSCLC PD-L1 modifier), P0576 (antibiotic systematic review timing), P0547 (antibiotic systematic review). Wait, P0576 and P0547 are in the deep read material. Let's pick P0517 (PD-L1 as effect modifier for antibiotics), P0576 (timing specificity pre-treatment vs concurrent), P0548 (mechanism/context dependency across tumor types).\n    Actually, P0517 is already somewhat covered by P0585/NIC arm, but P0517 specifically addresses PD-L1 expression modifying antibiotic impact. P0576 provides strong timing data. P0548 covers mechanism/context. Let's use P0517, P0576, P0548.\n\n    *Unit Ch1:3 (U3_动态监测与纵向演变)*\n    Existing: P0033, P0134, P0098, P0227, P0200, P0205, P0327, P0415, P0443, P0485.\n    Focus: Baseline snapshot limits, longitudinal dynamics (pathogen clearance/colonization failure), sampling challenges.\n    Gaps/Opportunities: Need more on early-stage/neoadjuvant dynamics, or specific longitudinal stability metrics. P0569 (neoadjuvant NSCLC, low baseline diversity/high stability predicts MPR), P0585 (FMT-LUMINate longitudinal pathogen loss), P0577 (MIMic trial longitudinal engraftment kinetics). P0569 is perfect for neoadjuvant context. P0577 provides detailed engraftment kinetics vs clinical benefit. P0585 is already in unit catalog cases but let's see if we can add P0569 and P0577. Wait, P0585 is already used. I'll add P0569 and P0577. Also P0546 (longitudinal modeling/dynamics). Let's stick to P0569, P0577, P0546.\n\n    *Unit Ch1:4 (U4_证据阶梯与转化边界)*\n    Existing: P0026, P0144, P0161, P0583, P0578, P0260, P0291, P0387, P0462, P0470.\n    Focus: Observational strength, FMT concept validation (positive/negative), Phase III gap, safety signals context-dependent.\n    Gaps/Opportunities: Need more on defined consortia/probiotics vs FMT, or specific safety/toxicity mechanistic links. P0573 (optimizing FMT, donor selection, protocol optimization), P0584 (navigating gut-metabolite-immune axis, toxicity mitigation strategies), P0600 (irAE prediction model & causal FMT mouse model for colitis). P0600 is excellent for irAE causality and prediction. P0573 covers FMT optimization challenges. P0584 covers toxicity mitigation and metabolite-based interventions. Let's use P0600, P0573, P0584.\n\n3.  **Draft Contributions (30-60 Chinese chars each):**\n    *Ch1:1*\n    - P0545: 提供波兰队列中饮食模式（高植物/低乳制品）与特定菌群（P. copri等）协同影响抗PD-1疗效的实证，支撑“微生物标志物具有人群与生活方式依赖性”的分析。\n    - P0565: 系统综述黑色素瘤数据，揭示真菌失调（如念珠菌、马拉色菌）与较差预后的关联，补充单一细菌视角局限，论证多界微生物生态对ICI疗效的综合调节作用。\n    - P0511: 基于转移性黑色素瘤宏基因组荟萃分析，确认维生素B代谢通路富集与响应正相关，为“功能趋同优于单一分类学标志物”提供跨队列统计支持。\n\n    *Ch1:2*\n    - P0517: 证实NSCLC中抗生素暴露的负面效应高度依赖PD-L1表达水平（≥50%组OS显著缩短），为“宿主生物标志物状态严格修饰微生物干预效应方向”提供临床分层依据。\n    - P0576: 系统综述明确ICI启动前30天内的抗生素暴露是预后恶化的核心风险窗口，同期暴露影响较弱，量化时间窗特异性并提示需区分暴露时机进行校正。\n    - P0548: 整合多尺度证据指出抗生素效应在不同实体瘤中存在异质性（如CRC/HCC可能中性或有益），警示简单归因于“菌群破坏”，强调需结合肿瘤免疫原性综合评估。\n\n    *Ch1:3*\n    - P0569: 报道早期NSCLC新辅助治疗中低基线α多样性与高纵向稳定性（自相似性）预示较好病理缓解，对比晚期研究结果，阐明疾病阶段与治疗强度对动态标志物的情境修饰。\n    - P0577: 详述M","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791151085,"id":"chatcmpl-b0929d71-f6e5-9859-8ff7-6bf6aedf27de","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":2977,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2048,"text_tokens":2977},"prompt_tokens":199276,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":199276},"total_tokens":202253}}